      ],
      "speaker": "NARRATION",
      "speaker_status": "narrator",
      "text_role": "NARRATED",
      "text": "IN THE SECOND CASE, THE IMPORTER -- ALSO UNDER INVESTIGATION FOR SMUGGLING. THIS TIME THERE WERE WITNESSES WHO SAW HIM JUMP OUT HIS APARTMENT WINDOW.. RIGHT IN THE MIDDLE OF A FAMILY DINNER",
