      "box_ids": [
        "PG2:T9"
      ],
      "speaker": "E3",
      "speaker_status": "linked",
      "text_role": "SPOKEN",
      "text": "NOT UNTIL THIS LAST CASE.",
      "needs_review": false
    },
    {
      "group_id": "PG2:T10",
      "box_ids": [
        "PG2:T10"
      ],
      "speaker": "E5",
      "speaker_status": "linked",
      "text_role": "SPOKEN",
      "text": "SAY YOU'RE ACTUALLY HARDCORE ENOUGH TO GO BY CUTTING YOUR OWN THROAT. BUT YOUVE GOT A BODY- GUARD. WELL, SIMPLE WAY WOULD BE IN THEJOHN, WHEN THE KNOCK COMES ON THE DOOR, TEN MINUTES LATER, TUB'S FULL.",
